/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*\
  Case-local DELTA of the standard KCl record: the one line this case needs.
  `overlayOf KCl;` -- the reader deep-merges this file over
  data/standards/components/KCl.dat, so everything else comes from the catalogue.
  The case exists to show the engine REFUSING a rank-deficient salt basis; the
  refusal is only reached when each salt is declared reactive (an aqueous
  speciation), which the catalogue record of KCl does not declare.
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
overlayOf KCl;
variationReason "declares the salt reactive (aqueousSpeciation KClSalt) so the basis-rank refusal, not an unrelated adapter refusal, is the case's outcome";

aqueousSpeciation  KClSalt;
